---
// Logo trial: "Zakaria" on a brown paper cut-out, overlapped by a smaller cut-out with زكـــريــــاء.
// Shown in full for 5 seconds, then both are cut down to their first letters (Z and ز) and become
// round cut-outs; hovering (or focusing) opens them again, at a steady (linear) speed set by
// --cut-time. The paper is redrawn from its width every frame (scripts/paper.ts), so it grows and
// shrinks instead of stretching. Arabic: the first word of the header name (Amiri Regular with
// kashida, SIL OFL), split into ز and the rest so the word can be cut back to ز.
interface Props { variant?: 'black' | 'blue' }
const { variant = 'black' } = Astro.props;
